BEHAVIOR make-server-addr

DESCRIPTION
  Creates sockaddr_in structure for listening on 0.0.0.0:9753
  AF_INET=2, port=9753 in network byte order, addr=0.0.0.0

CONTRACT
  OUTPUT addr bytes 128
  OUTPUT addr_len int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 25b33dd7

IMPLEMENTATION
  # sin_family = AF_INET = 2 (at offset 0, 2 bytes)
  STORE addr 2 2 0

  # sin_port = 9753 in network byte order
  # 9753 = 0x2619, swapped for little-endian storage = 0x1926 = 6438
  STORE addr 6438 2 2

  # sin_addr = 0.0.0.0 (at offset 4, 4 bytes)
  STORE addr 0 4 4

  # Zero padding (offsets 8-15)
  STORE addr 0 8 8

  # Set address length
  STORE addr_len 16 8
END
